      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.38,
      "end_seconds": 285.25,
      "duration_seconds": 15.87,
      "text": "pace your activity and increase it slowly each week i think the post-COVID clinic should see you too come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse let's plan a check in six weeks"
